WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
AI can build your application fast.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
But fast doesn't always mean ready.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Nettle scans your application for security, legal, compliance, and readiness gaps.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Instead of just finding problems, Nettle explains what's missing and why it matters.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Nettle recommends practical ways to fix the gap.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Fix it. Rescan it. Verify it.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.000
And keep monitoring as your application evolves.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Build fast. Know what you missed. Nettle.
